{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_074A00","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Cocoon的设计在处理废热上吃了不少苦。身为设计者，说来有点丢脸，但散热器或许算得上它的弱点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"散热器部分没多少装甲，因为装甲会妨碍散热……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"散热器在哪？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"上部和下部都有多个散热器。具体位置看排气应该就能判断。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"不过，上部散热器平时不会露出来。也许可以先瞄准下部散热器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"下部散热器可以钻到机体下面去打，但本体会上下移动。小心别被压扁。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"另外，小心导弹和Hedgehog。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Hedgehog？反潜用的多联装散布式深水炸弹吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"它是在那项技术基础上改造成地面用的武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，无论Hedgehog还是导弹，装填都需要时间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"指示灯熄灭时，Hedgehog应该无法发射。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"导弹的话，注意观察发射舱门的动作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"看来可以趁那段时间接近。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"发射舱门一打开，也要小心导弹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""}]}